Package: definecore
Title: Generate CDISC Define-XML from Metacore Objects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Shakhar Eranna Chalwadi", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "skrchalwadicg@gmail.com")
Description: Generates CDISC Define-XML documents (versions 2.0 and 2.1) from
    metacore metadata objects. Maps dataset, variable, codelist, and derivation
    information into an ODM-based Define-XML structure suitable for further
    review and regulatory use. Integrates with the pharmaverse metacore ecosystem.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/shekharchalwadigrepo-hub/definecore
BugReports: https://github.com/shekharchalwadigrepo-hub/definecore/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    metacore,
    xml2,
    dplyr,
    rlang,
    cli,
    glue,
    magrittr
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
Encoding: UTF-8
